{#
  The ONE dialog of the flow diagram (since 2.3, lazy dialogs): an empty UiKit `remote_form_dialog` shell. Every place
  and transition of the diagram is a link to its own page (nowo_workflow_definition_place / _transition); on open,
  js/nowo-ui-dialog.js fetches that page with `X-Nowo-Dialog: 1` and shows its fragment (_flow_place.html.twig /
  _flow_transition.html.twig) here. The transition links of a place load the transition into the same dialog. Without
  JavaScript the links open the full page. Before 2.3 this template printed one dialog per place and per transition.

  Required: graph (WorkflowGraphPresenter::present()), bundle.
  Optional: dialog_id (default workflow-flow-detail; the diagram's openers use the same default).
#}
{{ include(nowo_ui_partial('remote_form_dialog', bundle), {
    id: dialog_id|default('workflow-flow-detail'),
    title: 'diagram.title'|trans({}, 'NowoWorkflowBundle'),
    size: 'md',
    attr: {'data-testid': 'workflow-flow-dialog'},
    bundle: bundle,
}, false) }}
